4. mandatory reads: TASK_INDEX/DEPENDENCY_GRAPH; ADR-006 Decisions1–8; ADR-001 domain/history/object and ADR-004/005 identity/audit by reference; TASK_EXECUTION_PROTOCOL/DEC0068/69/owner standing directive; MODULE_BOUNDARIES; current domain/history/object/reversibility profiles and E3 manifest.
