9. validation / architecture / integration checks: Manual ADR category completeness and task/boundary review; all11E10/indexes/diff --check; exact-head applicable greenCI and independent gpt-6-luna max T3 review. No executable test for list-only scope.
10. migration / rollback needs: None; reviewed document amendments, preserved current negatives/history.
11. responsive / accessibility rules: No UI; owner explanation describes records that must survive restart without technical debugging.
12. evidence + handoff format: E-DEV-025 normalized digest, category scope/limits, actual checks/CI and independent reviewer/context/model/head/verdict/finding closure plus owner standing acceptance.
13. graph-update records: T-E3-034 REVIEW/evidence and indexes; no store/recovery/queue/environment or T-E3-001-R1 completion.
14. escalation rules: Missing authoritative state holds effects or remains uncertain/quarantined; no default positive authority. Live custody/restore require separately proved gates.

